A one-screen reminder of every construct in the quaydoc markup language.
See [[Writing pages]] for the full reference.

## Blocks

````
# H1
## H2
- unordered item
1. ordered item
> quote line
```
fenced code
```
[note] a callout
---
````

## Inline

| source | renders as |
|---|---|
| `**bold**` | **bold** |
| `` `code` `` | `code` |
| `[[A page title]]` | reference link |
| `[[A page title|label]]` | labelled reference |
| `[label](https://example.org)` | external link |
| `![alt](img.png)` | image |
| `\\*` | `*` |

## Front matter

```
---
title: Page title
order: 10
tags: [guide]
draft: false
---
```
